# Day 2 Graded Deliverable

## Part 1 - String Manipulation Script
This program accepts a sentence from the user and displays:
 Total character count
 Uppercase and lowercase versions
 Reversed sentence
 Word count
 First and last words
 Palindrome check (ignoring spaces and letter case)

## Part 2 - Simple Calculator Revisited
This program accepts two numbers from the user and performs:
 Addition (+)
 Subtraction (-)
 Multiplication (*)
 Division (/)
 Floor Division (//)
 Modulus (%)
 Exponentiation (**)
